==English==

===Etymology===
From obsolete {{suffix|en|sulter|pos1=verb, variant of {{m|en|swelter}}|y}}. Compare {{m|en|sweltry}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈsʌltɹi/|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|er}}

# {{lb|en|weather}} [[hot]] and [[humid]]
# very hot and [[dry]]; [[torrid]]
# [[sexually]] [[enthralling]]

